Contributing to SCOPE

Open an issue with a reproducible command and configuration before proposing
a large change. Keep patches focused and preserve third-party notices.

Build with make -j2 and run python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v.
For model changes, include a dimensional check, parameter sources, and a
comparison using the same workload and capacity budget. Report assumptions
and results even when they differ from the expected architecture ranking.

Generated reports and simulation outputs stay local. Submit source changes,
tests, configuration and README updates through a pull request.
